From 1719b25cc2d7736e3319d404824945bf38d51d4a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gabriel Briffe <10479082+gabriel-briffe@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 17:40:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Device/Driver/OatHid: Read outside air temperature from the
 HID probe

The probe's HID identity (2E8A:0A01) is not a serial port, so Android
opens it as USB HID and the OAT HID driver. A desk TCP client on port
4354 feeds the same four-byte report. OpenVario $POV,T is unchanged.
